    "detailed_description": "'Numb - Just Don't Think About It' is a minimalistic psychological horror game inspired by the likes of 'Home,' 'Claire,' 'Lone Survivor,' and 'World of Horror'.<br><br>You are B, an unextraordinary individual embodying modern society's struggles. A monotonous day turns nightmarish as one of your apartment building\u2019s residents dies in mysterious circumstances and the hallways morph into an ethereal labyrinth filled with unsettling creatures. Trapped inside, you need to face all kinds of horrors to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b1b Explore</h2><br>Navigate through hallways of fear, search for and use items to progress, and unveil the truth. Pay attention to your surroundings: danger is always around the corner, and nothing is as it seems.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458780/extras/99236e0c448560733471ad2ded3a239f.poster.avif?t=1716564245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458780/extras/99236e0c448560733471ad2ded3a239f.webm?t=1716564245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458780/extras/99236e0c448560733471ad2ded3a239f.mp4?t=1716564245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b1b Fight</h2><br>Face different challenges every day. Confront horrors in various ways: shoot, close your eyes, or bypass them, but keep moving forward.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458780/extras/f65986ffdafdfea68c7ddaa15d456468.poster.avif?t=1716564245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458780/extras/f65986ffdafdfea68c7ddaa15d456468.webm?t=1716564245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458780/extras/f65986ffdafdfea68c7ddaa15d456468.mp4?t=1716564245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b1b Survive</h2><br>Maintain that shred of sanity you have left by holding on to the routines that ground you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458780/extras/3665bcd7e1ce320e14a3ad744d4e9783.poster.avif?t=1716564245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458780/extras/3665bcd7e1ce320e14a3ad744d4e9783.webm?t=1716564245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458780/extras/3665bcd7e1ce320e14a3ad744d4e9783.mp4?t=1716564245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
